# OpenTA AI Agent Flow Analysis — `/chat/basic` Endpoint

> [!NOTE]
> This analysis covers the **basic mode** flow from the moment a user sends a message to the final streamed (or non-streaming) response. The codebase uses **DSPy** as the LLM orchestration framework.

---

## High-Level Architecture

```mermaid
graph TB
    User["🧑 User (Frontend)"]
    API["POST /chat/basic"]
    Auth["JWT Auth Guard"]
    History["Session Manager (Redis → DB)"]
    RAG["RAGService"]
    Stream["stream_dspy_response()"]

    User -->|ChatRequest| API
    API --> Auth
    Auth --> API
    API --> History
    History -->|raw_history| API

    API -->|stream=false| RAG
    API -->|stream=true| Stream

    RAG -->|ChatResponse JSON| User
    Stream -->|SSE event stream| User
```

---

## Entry Point: [chat.py](file:///c:/Users/emirsyah/Documents/CODING/openta/open-ta-telyu-dspy/backend/app/api/routes/chat.py)

The `POST /chat/basic` endpoint in [chat_basic()](file:///c:/Users/emirsyah/Documents/CODING/openta/open-ta-telyu-dspy/backend/app/api/routes/chat.py#L83-L205) does the following:

1. **Extract params** — [query](file:///c:/Users/emirsyah/Documents/CODING/openta/open-ta-telyu-dspy/backend/app/core/models.py#137-140), [stream](file:///c:/Users/emirsyah/Documents/CODING/openta/open-ta-telyu-dspy/backend/app/core/models.py#141-146), [conversation_id](file:///c:/Users/emirsyah/Documents/CODING/openta/open-ta-telyu-dspy/backend/app/core/models.py#147-150), `user_id`, `meta_params`
2. **Load history** — via [_load_history()](file:///c:/Users/emirsyah/Documents/CODING/openta/open-ta-telyu-dspy/backend/app/api/routes/chat.py#22-34) (Redis first, DB fallback), capped at last **5 turns**
3. **Convert history** — `rag_service._convert_to_dspy_history(raw_history)` → `dspy.History`
4. **Branch** on [stream](file:///c:/Users/emirsyah/Documents/CODING/openta/open-ta-telyu-dspy/backend/app/core/models.py#141-146) flag:
   - `stream=false` → calls `rag_service.chat()` (non-streaming path)
   - `stream=true` → returns `StreamingResponse(stream_dspy_response(...))` (SSE path)

---

## Path A: Non-Streaming Flow (`stream=false`)

Handled entirely by [RAGService.chat()](file:///c:/Users/emirsyah/Documents/CODING/openta/open-ta-telyu-dspy/backend/app/services/rag.py#L402-L550).

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant API as /chat/basic
    participant RAG as RAGService.chat()
    participant IC as IntentClassifier (cheap LM)
    participant QG as QueryGenerator (cheap LM)
    participant RET as PaperRetriever (Voyage AI + PGVector)
    participant QR as QueryReformulator
    participant PM as PaperRAG (ChainOfThought)
    participant GD as GapDetector

    FE->>API: POST {query, stream: false}
    API->>RAG: chat(question, history)

    Note over RAG: Step 0 — Classify Intent
    RAG->>IC: question → "research" | "general"
    IC-->>RAG: category

    alt General question
        RAG->>PM: question + "No paper context" + history
        PM-->>RAG: answer (no sources)
        RAG-->>API: {answer, sources: []}
    end

    Note over RAG: Step 1 — Generate Search Query
    RAG->>QG: user_question → search keywords
    QG-->>RAG: search_query

    Note over RAG: Step 2 — Retrieve Papers
    RAG->>RET: search_query → vector search (Voyage AI embeddings + PGVector)
    RET-->>RAG: context + papers

    alt Zero results
        RAG->>QR: reformulate query (broader keywords)
        QR-->>RAG: broader_query
        RAG->>RET: retry with broader_query
        RET-->>RAG: context + papers
    end

    Note over RAG: Step 3 — Generate Answer
    RAG->>PM: question + context + history (ChainOfThought)
    PM-->>RAG: answer + sources + reasoning

    Note over RAG: Step 4 — Gap Detection (Adaptive Re-Retrieval)
    RAG->>GD: question + answer → "complete" | "partial"
    alt Partial — gap detected
        GD-->>RAG: gap_query
        RAG->>RET: gap_query → extra papers
        RAG->>PM: re-generate with enriched context
        PM-->>RAG: refined answer + refined sources
    end

    RAG-->>API: {answer, sources, rationale, search_query}
    API-->>FE: ChatResponse JSON
```

### Non-Streaming Step Breakdown

| Step | Component | Model Used | Purpose |
|------|-----------|-----------|---------|
| 0 | [IntentClassifier](file:///c:/Users/emirsyah/Documents/CODING/openta/open-ta-telyu-dspy/backend/app/services/rag.py#169-177) | cheap LM (if set) | Route: "research" vs "general" |
| 1 | [QueryGenerator](file:///c:/Users/emirsyah/Documents/CODING/openta/open-ta-telyu-dspy/backend/app/services/rag.py#189-216) | cheap LM (if set) | Convert question → optimized search keywords |
| 2 | [PaperRetriever](file:///c:/Users/emirsyah/Documents/CODING/openta/open-ta-telyu-dspy/backend/app/services/retriever.py#14-231) | Voyage AI (embeddings) | Vector similarity search in PGVector |
| 2b | [QueryReformulator](file:///c:/Users/emirsyah/Documents/CODING/openta/open-ta-telyu-dspy/backend/app/services/rag.py#218-228) | cheap LM (if set) | Retry with broader keywords on zero results |
| 3 | [PaperRAG](file:///c:/Users/emirsyah/Documents/CODING/openta/open-ta-telyu-dspy/backend/app/services/rag.py#241-288) (ChainOfThought) | **main LM** | Generate answer with citations |
| 4 | [GapDetector](file:///c:/Users/emirsyah/Documents/CODING/openta/open-ta-telyu-dspy/backend/app/services/rag.py#230-239) | cheap LM (if set) | Check answer completeness, re-retrieve if partial |

### Post-Response (Background Tasks)
- **Save history** → [_save_history()](file:///c:/Users/emirsyah/Documents/CODING/openta/open-ta-telyu-dspy/backend/app/api/routes/chat.py#36-62) (Redis + DB)
- **Generate title** (first message only) → [_generate_and_save_title_bg()](file:///c:/Users/emirsyah/Documents/CODING/openta/open-ta-telyu-dspy/backend/app/api/routes/chat.py#208-217) using [TitleGenerationSignature](file:///c:/Users/emirsyah/Documents/CODING/openta/open-ta-telyu-dspy/backend/app/services/rag.py#105-115)
- **Citation audit** → [_audit_citations()](file:///c:/Users/emirsyah/Documents/CODING/openta/open-ta-telyu-dspy/backend/app/utils/streaming.py#67-84) (pure Python regex check, no LLM)

---

## Path B: Streaming Flow (`stream=true`)

Handled by [stream_dspy_response()](file:///c:/Users/emirsyah/Documents/CODING/openta/open-ta-telyu-dspy/backend/app/utils/streaming.py#L299-L806) — a Manus-like planning + execution UX.

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant FE as Frontend (SSE)
    participant S as stream_dspy_response()
    participant IC as IntentClassifier
    participant QG as QueryGenerator
    participant AG as AcknowledgmentGenerator
    participant PL as ResearchPlanner
    participant QD as QueryDecomposer
    participant RET as PaperRetriever
    participant QR as QueryReformulator
    participant DSPy as PaperRAG (streamify)
    participant GD as GapDetector

    Note over S: Phase 1 — Classify + Pre-generate Query (PARALLEL)
    S-->>FE: SSE: simple_thinking
    S-->>FE: SSE: status/classifying
    par Parallel Execution
        S->>IC: classify intent
        S->>QG: generate search query
    end
    IC-->>S: "research" | "general"
    S-->>FE: SSE: status/classified

    alt Research question
        S->>AG: generate acknowledgment
        AG-->>S: brief context-aware acknowledgment
        S-->>FE: SSE: acknowledgment
    end

    alt General question
        Note over S: Skip planning, stream answer directly
        S->>DSPy: streamify(reasoning + answer)
        loop Token stream
            DSPy-->>S: reasoning tokens
            S-->>FE: SSE: thinking_token
            DSPy-->>S: answer tokens
            S-->>FE: SSE: token
        end
        DSPy-->>S: final Prediction
        S-->>FE: SSE: done {answer, sources:[]}
        S-->>FE: SSE: [DONE]
    end

    Note over S: Phase 2 — Planning (Research Questions)
    QG-->>S: pre_generated_query
    S-->>FE: SSE: status/planning

    alt Complex question (≥20 words or comparison keywords)
        S->>PL: create_plan(question, is_research) — uses MAIN LM
    else Simple question
        S->>S: default_plan() — skip planner LLM call
    end
    PL-->>S: List[SmartPlanStep]
    S-->>FE: SSE: plan {steps}

    Note over S: Phase 3 — Execute Steps
    loop For each plan step
        S-->>FE: SSE: step_start

        alt Step needs search (research/comparison/analysis)
            alt multi_query strategy
                S->>QD: decompose into 2-4 sub-queries
                S->>RET: parallel_retrieve (all sub-queries concurrently)
            else single strategy
                S->>QG: generate query (or use pre-generated)
                S->>RET: get_papers_with_context
                alt Zero results
                    S->>QR: reformulate query
                    S->>RET: retry with broader query
                end
            end
            S-->>FE: SSE: step_action {search, query}
            S-->>FE: SSE: step_action_result {paper_count}
        end

        S->>PL: step_thinker (stream thinking for this step)
        loop Thinking tokens
            PL-->>S: thinking chunk
            S-->>FE: SSE: step_thinking {step_id, content}
        end
        S-->>FE: SSE: step_done
    end

    Note over S: Phase 4 — Stream Final Answer (CoT + Answer)
    S-->>FE: SSE: answer_start
    S-->>FE: SSE: thinking_start
    S->>DSPy: streamify(reasoning + answer) with combined context

    loop CoT Reasoning tokens
        DSPy-->>S: reasoning chunk
        S-->>FE: SSE: thinking_token
    end
    S-->>FE: SSE: thinking_end

    loop Answer tokens
        DSPy-->>S: answer chunk
        S-->>FE: SSE: token
    end
    DSPy-->>S: final Prediction
    S-->>FE: SSE: done {answer, sources}

    Note over S: Phase 5 — Post-Stream
    S->>S: citation audit (pure Python)
    S-->>FE: SSE: citation_audit

    alt Gap detected
        S->>GD: check completeness
        GD-->>S: partial + gap_query
        S-->>FE: SSE: refinement_start
        S->>RET: retrieve additional papers
        S->>DSPy: re-generate with enriched context
        loop Refinement tokens
            S-->>FE: SSE: refinement_token
        end
        S-->>FE: SSE: refinement_done
    end

    S-->>FE: SSE: title (if first message)
    S-->>FE: SSE: [DONE]
```

---

## SSE Event Contract

The streaming path emits events in the following order:

| Event Type | Payload | When |
|-----------|---------|------|
| `simple_thinking` | `{message}` | Immediately — shimmer in UI |
| `status` | `{step, message}` | Classification progress |
| `acknowledgment` | `{content}` | Research questions only — brief ack |
| [plan](file:///c:/Users/emirsyah/Documents/CODING/openta/open-ta-telyu-dspy/backend/app/services/planner.py#107-148) | `{steps[]}` | After planning phase |
| `step_start` | `{step_id, title, description}` | Each step begins |
| `step_action` | `{step_id, action, query}` | Search/query actions |
| `step_action_result` | `{step_id, action, paper_count}` | Search results |
| [step_thinking](file:///c:/Users/emirsyah/Documents/CODING/openta/open-ta-telyu-dspy/backend/app/utils/streaming.py#259-293) | `{step_id, content}` | Streamed thinking tokens per step |
| `step_done` | `{step_id}` | Step completed |
| `answer_start` | `{}` | Answer generation begins |
| `thinking_start` | `{}` | CoT reasoning begins |
| `thinking_token` | `{content}` | Streamed CoT reasoning tokens |
| `thinking_end` | `{}` | CoT reasoning finished |
| [token](file:///c:/Users/emirsyah/Documents/CODING/openta/open-ta-telyu-dspy/backend/app/utils/streaming.py#655-691) | `{content}` | Streamed answer tokens |
| `done` | `{content, sources[]}` | Complete answer + cited sources |
| `citation_audit` | `{is_clean, hallucinated_citation_numbers, ...}` | Post-answer |
| `refinement_start` | `{gap_query}` | If gaps detected |
| [refinement_token](file:///c:/Users/emirsyah/Documents/CODING/openta/open-ta-telyu-dspy/backend/app/utils/streaming.py#756-771) | `{content}` | Streamed refinement tokens |
| `refinement_done` | `{content, sources[]}` | Refined answer |
| [title](file:///c:/Users/emirsyah/Documents/CODING/openta/open-ta-telyu-dspy/backend/app/api/routes/chat.py#64-81) | `{content}` | Auto-generated title (first message) |
| `[DONE]` | — | Stream end signal |

---

## Key DSPy Modules & Signatures

```mermaid
graph LR
    subgraph "Cheap LM (cost-saving)"
        IC["IntentClassifier<br/>(IntentClassificationSignature)"]
        QG["QueryGenerator<br/>(QueryGenerationSignature)"]
        QR["QueryReformulator<br/>(QueryReformulationSignature)"]
        AG["AcknowledgmentGenerator<br/>(AcknowledgmentSignature)"]
        GD["GapDetector<br/>(GapDetectionSignature)"]
        QD["QueryDecomposer<br/>(QueryDecompositionSignature)"]
    end

    subgraph "Main LM (quality-critical)"
        PL["ResearchPlanner<br/>(ResearchPlanSignature)"]
        RAG["PaperRAG (ChainOfThought)<br/>(PaperChatSignature)"]
        TG["TitleGenerator<br/>(TitleGenerationSignature)"]
    end

    subgraph "Non-LLM"
        RET["PaperRetriever<br/>(Voyage AI + PGVector)"]
        CA["Citation Audit<br/>(pure Python regex)"]
        PR["parallel_retrieve()"]
    end
```

| Module | Signature | Model | Purpose |
|--------|-----------|-------|---------|
| [IntentClassifier](file:///c:/Users/emirsyah/Documents/CODING/openta/open-ta-telyu-dspy/backend/app/services/rag.py#169-177) | [IntentClassificationSignature](file:///c:/Users/emirsyah/Documents/CODING/openta/open-ta-telyu-dspy/backend/app/services/rag.py#117-128) | cheap LM | Route "research" vs "general" |
| [QueryGenerator](file:///c:/Users/emirsyah/Documents/CODING/openta/open-ta-telyu-dspy/backend/app/services/rag.py#189-216) | [QueryGenerationSignature](file:///c:/Users/emirsyah/Documents/CODING/openta/open-ta-telyu-dspy/backend/app/services/rag.py#19-28) | cheap LM | Natural language → search keywords |
| [QueryReformulator](file:///c:/Users/emirsyah/Documents/CODING/openta/open-ta-telyu-dspy/backend/app/services/rag.py#218-228) | [QueryReformulationSignature](file:///c:/Users/emirsyah/Documents/CODING/openta/open-ta-telyu-dspy/backend/app/services/rag.py#30-38) | cheap LM | Broaden failed queries |
| [QueryDecomposer](file:///c:/Users/emirsyah/Documents/CODING/openta/open-ta-telyu-dspy/backend/app/services/query_decomposer.py#42-79) | [QueryDecompositionSignature](file:///c:/Users/emirsyah/Documents/CODING/openta/open-ta-telyu-dspy/backend/app/services/query_decomposer.py#13-40) | cheap LM | Split complex query into 2-4 sub-queries |
| [AcknowledgmentGenerator](file:///c:/Users/emirsyah/Documents/CODING/openta/open-ta-telyu-dspy/backend/app/services/rag.py#179-187) | [AcknowledgmentSignature](file:///c:/Users/emirsyah/Documents/CODING/openta/open-ta-telyu-dspy/backend/app/services/rag.py#145-167) | cheap LM | Quick ack before research |
| [GapDetector](file:///c:/Users/emirsyah/Documents/CODING/openta/open-ta-telyu-dspy/backend/app/services/rag.py#230-239) | [GapDetectionSignature](file:///c:/Users/emirsyah/Documents/CODING/openta/open-ta-telyu-dspy/backend/app/services/rag.py#130-143) | cheap LM | Detect missing aspects in answer |
| [ResearchPlanner](file:///c:/Users/emirsyah/Documents/CODING/openta/open-ta-telyu-dspy/backend/app/services/planner.py#101-148) | [ResearchPlanSignature](file:///c:/Users/emirsyah/Documents/CODING/openta/open-ta-telyu-dspy/backend/app/services/planner.py#44-79) | **main LM** | Create 2-3 step research plan |
| [PaperRAG](file:///c:/Users/emirsyah/Documents/CODING/openta/open-ta-telyu-dspy/backend/app/services/rag.py#241-288) | [PaperChatSignature](file:///c:/Users/emirsyah/Documents/CODING/openta/open-ta-telyu-dspy/backend/app/services/rag.py#41-103) (ChainOfThought) | **main LM** | Generate cited answer |
| `TitleGenerator` | [TitleGenerationSignature](file:///c:/Users/emirsyah/Documents/CODING/openta/open-ta-telyu-dspy/backend/app/services/rag.py#105-115) | cheap LM | Auto-generate conversation title |

